+// ALHIJRAH assessment engine — persistence and the visibility gate.
+// Flow: any data change → refreshEngine() builds a deterministic package (no AI) from the stored rule evaluation, CRS,
+// facts, extraction results, employers and draws; identical content is not stored twice (package hash), and a package
+// computed while the case changed underneath is discarded (data_revision guard). Staff edits live separately and are never
+// overwritten by a refresh. publish() freezes a client-safe snapshot as a numbered publication; clients read only the latest
+// non-withdrawn publication. Every step is written to the hash-chained audit log.
+import { getDb } from '@/db';
